OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry through
OL,6,Fthe evening with increasing clear
OL,7,Fspells and light winds. Staying dry
OL,8,Fwith lengthy clear periods overnight.
OL,9,FBecoming cold overnight with slight
OL,10,Ffrost across Deeside.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FDry and bright but chilly
OL,13,Fstart. Sunshine turning hazy as high
OL,14,Fcloud gradually spills east through
OL,15,Fthe afternoon ahead of rain in the
OL,16,Fevening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
