OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FAny
OL,6,Fcloud and rain soon clearing east
OL,7,FFriday morning to become dry with
OL,8,Fsunny spells. Bright spells and just
OL,9,Fthe odd shower on Saturday. Showery
OL,10,Frain spreads east on Sunday.
